{
  "_note": "type: pierce | slash | crush. range in tiles. cycle in seconds before the agility factor (the attack speed of the weapon). Every blow or shot does the weapon damage plus the damage stat of the fighter. crit: base chance of a critical blow or shot, 0 to 1 (none have any; research gives it, never above rules.critMax). A critical one does critDamage times the damage (1.25 = 125% of a normal blow, 4 = four times), or the weapon's own critDamage. The research of each weapon (aspd, crit, critd in researchtree.json) is added to the weapon of whoever holds it: aspd by a percent, crit and critd by real points (0.5 = half a percent of chance; 100 = one more time the damage). cost/time/tier only for what the player can craft; others are used by tribes. style: which set of fighting animations the weapon uses (see \"styles\"); anims overrides single states for one weapon; projectile: what a ranged weapon fires. Thời Trung cổ (tier 4): arming_sword (style sword_shield, có khiên), composite_bow, lance (style rider_lance, ngồi trên ngựa) và giáp footman, archer, rider; chưa có công thức chế tạo, chỉ có qua dev hoặc bộ tộc. `shield`: khiên vẽ ở tay trái (src/data/shields). rank: bậc lính mang được vũ khí này (ranks.json); tier vẫn là vật liệu (màu đầu vũ khí, khóa trong kho).",
